#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/cmd_knock.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When you knock on a channel, all operators and owners in that channel receive a notification showing your nickname and optional message. The Channel List marks invite-only channels with a +i badge and changes Join to Request Access..., which opens the same knock request flow with an optional 200-character message. Operators can then decide whether to invite you using"
